{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Pigeon Mafia》是一款以公園鴿子集團為主題的投擲策略遊戲，玩家扮演退休麵包師，利用有限麵包招募鴿子並在時限內向 Don 繳交鳥糞配額，適合喜歡輕鬆投擲與升級收集的玩家。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-118.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>投擲麵包招募鴿子</h2>\n<p>玩家可拖放或快速滑動投擲麵包，虛線弧線會預示落點；每回合麵包有限，成功抓到鴿子可補回一條，落地的麵包則消失。公園內有巡邏警察、長椅老手、黃昏盜賊鼠及廣場 Boss 干擾，即使失敗也可獲得鳥糞，在教父帳簿換取手臂、袋子、瞄準與人脈的永久升級。歐洲巡迴中，可招募 Limpy Pigeon、Pickpocket、Goon、Golden Pigeon、Capo 與 Mega-Pigeon，並收集普通、3D 浮雕及全息卡。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-106-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-107-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-108-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-109-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-110-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-111-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Pigeon Mafia: Park Syndicate</li><li>應用類別：Entertainment</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pigeon-mafia-park-syndicate/id6816239293?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.621645+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":398,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T10:59:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:43.218429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.548928+00:00","content_hash":"101197821ca63bd7c570a3fe7436c1d4409de2aa85fcaffff688f31efa3c8a5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}